<% if @reason == :unverified_email -%>
# Verify your email to claim this agent

An agent signup is claimed by whoever holds the email address it names. Verify yours at [/activate](/activate), then open the claim link again.
<% elsif @reason == :not_addressed -%>
# This request is not addressed to you

An agent signup can only be claimed by the person whose email address it names.
<% elsif @reason == :expired -%>
# This request has expired

The request lapsed before it was claimed. The agent can start a new signup.
<% elsif @reason == :declined -%>
# This request was declined

No agent was created. The agent can start a new signup.
<% elsif @reason == :claimed -%>
# This agent is already claimed
<% if @claimed_agent_handle -%>

Agent: [/ai-agents/<%= @claimed_agent_handle %>](/ai-agents/<%= @claimed_agent_handle %>)
<% end -%>
<% end -%>
